# Evaluation and benchmark output, from /dotnet-selfeval and /dotnet-performance.
# These are run artefacts, not documentation: each one measures the tools as they stood on its own
# date, so a report goes stale the moment the finding it raised is fixed - and several in the tree
# already described behaviour that had since changed. Shipping them invites a reader to take a
# superseded measurement as current. The conclusions that survived are written up in
# docs/benchmarks.md, which is maintained; the raw runs stay local.
.claude/dotnet-toolkit/eval/
.claude/dotnet-toolkit/perf/
